# Keep the image lean and secret-free. The Dockerfile copies only
# requirements.txt, app/, ml/ and models/ explicitly; this file is
# belt-and-braces for any future broader COPY.
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
.git/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.ipynb
logs/
*.log
# Local env files are never baked in; Render injects env at runtime.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
# NOTE: backend/models/ must NOT be ignored — trained artifacts are required.
